│ ```                                          │
│ something-to-include.rst:                    │
│ ```reStructuredText                          │
│ Testing                                      │
│ =======                                      │
│                                              │
│ &REPLACE_ME;                                 │
│ ```                                          │
│ my-extension.py:                             │
